@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Foundation";
}

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <span class="phase-label">Phase 02: Domain and Application Core</span>
    <h1 id="page-title">AppSupportHub</h1>
    <p class="lead">
        A portfolio foundation for an internal application-support and change-management portal.
    </p>
    <p>
        Systems and WorkItems business rules and Application use cases are now implemented and
        tested. Persistence and business-facing Web or API workflows remain planned and are not
        exposed by this foundation page.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="foundation-grid" aria-label="Current foundation">
    <article>
        <h2>Clear boundaries</h2>
        <p>A modular monolith separates Domain, Application, Infrastructure, and Web concerns.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
        <h2>Enforced quality</h2>
        <p>Central build standards and architecture tests keep the foundation consistent.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
        <h2>Operational baseline</h2>
        <p>A Razor Pages host and liveness health check provide a small, verifiable starting point.</p>
    </article>
</section>

<aside class="disclaimer" aria-label="Project disclaimer">
    AppSupportHub is an independent portfolio project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
    or built for the City of Winnipeg.
</aside>
